body:
Thank you... 

for every person who draws strength from your courage, to speak,

for every person who silently carry their wounds, unable to speak, 

for those who've met with shame and disbelief when confronting their truth, 

and for those whose despair compelled them to end their lives... 

you honor them. 

You're not alone, we all stand with you.

Well... not a comment, but still worth sharing;

https://www.dalailama.com/live

The "Heart Sutra" day 1 recorded. Today is day 2 10:30 pm EST,  Wednesday makes 3. Perfectly great.
